# Overlay: the X500 square flown as SPLINE legs (the same four points as params/x500.params; a file
# with WAYPOINT or SPLINE lines replaces the mission). Each corner is passed at speed on a curve
# through the waypoint. Load after the vehicle file:
# --params params/x500.params --params params/x500-spline.params
SPLINE  4  0  -2
SPLINE  4  4  -3
SPLINE  0  4  -3
SPLINE  0  0  -2
